msgid ""
"Blender Version Compatibility Layer\n"
"------------------------------------\n"
"Provides helpers to abstract over API changes across Blender versions.\n"
"Currently addresses the Blender 5.2+ change where NodesModifier no longer\n"
"supports IDProperties (mod[key] / key in mod).\n"
"\n"
"In Blender 5.2+, the modifier stores input values in:\n"
"    mod.properties.inputs.{identifier}.value\n"
"\n"
"Per the official 5.2 release notes:\n"
"    # Before (4.x)\n"
"    modifier[\"identifier\"] = 5.0\n"
"    # After (5.2+)\n"
"    modifier.properties.inputs.identifier.value = 5.0\n"
"\n"
"Usage:\n"
"    from .blender_compat import mod_get, mod_set, mod_contains"
msgstr ""
"Blender 版本兼容性层\n"
"------------------------------------\n"
"提供辅助工具，以在不同 Blender 版本之间的 API 变更上进行抽象。\n"
"目前解决了 Blender 5.2+ 中的变化：NodesModifier 不再支持 IDProperties（mod[key] / key in mod）。\n"
"\n"
"在 Blender 5.2+ 中，修饰器将输入值存储在:\n"
"    mod.properties.inputs.{identifier}.value\n"
"\n"
"根据官方 5.2 发布说明：\n"
"    # 之前 (4.x)\n"
"    modifier['identifier'] = 5.0\n"
"    # 之后 (5.2+)\n"
"    modifier.properties.inputs.identifier.value = 5.0\n"
"\n"
"用法:\n"
"    from .blender_compat import mod_get, mod_set, mod_contains"

