msgid ""
"Sync default values from the node group interface to the modifier inputs.\n"
"\n"
"In Blender 5.2+, when a new NodesModifier is created and assigned a node_group,\n"
"primitive socket types (float, int, bool, etc.) inherit their default_value\n"
"automatically. However, datablock socket types (Material, Object, Collection)\n"
"start at None and must be synced explicitly.\n"
"\n"
"This function only syncs datablock sockets that are currently None,\n"
"to avoid overwriting user-set values.\n"
"\n"
"Safe to call on any Blender version — no-op on 4.x and below."
msgstr ""
"Sync default values from the node group interface to the modifier inputs.\n"
"\n"
"In Blender 5.2+, when a new NodesModifier is created and assigned a node_group,\n"
