msgstr "指针文件的完整路径，该文件记录模块的活跃目录。"

msgid "Return the active version dir name for a module, or None."
msgstr "返回模块的活跃版本目录名，或 None。"

msgid "Atomically set the active version dir for a module."
msgstr "原子性地设置模块的活跃版本目录。"

msgid "Return the absolute path of the active version dir, or None."
msgstr "返回活跃版本目录的绝对路径，或 None。"

msgid ""
"Point sys.path at the ACTIVE version dirs, keeping the user site as fallback.\n"
"\n"
"We add the ACTIVE versioned dirs (e.g. deps_dir/PIL-<ts>) to the FRONT of\n"
"sys.path so they take priority. We do NOT remove the shared --user\n"
"site-packages: it is a legitimate fallback where PIL/resvg may already be\n"
"installed (e.g. a previous manual `pip install --user`). Removing it would\n"
"break installs that rely on it and cause a cascade of \"No module named\n"
"'PIL'\" errors. Our deps_dir dirs simply shadow it when present.\n"
"\n"
"CRITICAL: we ALSO add the user site-packages to sys.path if it is not\n"
"already there. Blender does NOT put the user site on sys.path at startup\n"
"(ENABLE_USER_SITE is False in some builds, and even when enabled the user\n"
"site is not always present). If PIL/resvg are installed in the user site\n"
"(e.g. a previous `pip install --user`), they would be invisible until\n"
"t3dn_bip.utils adds the user site — which happens too late, AFTER the\n"
"icon-loading threads have already started failing. Adding it here, at\n"
"startup, prevents the flood of \"No module named 'PIL'\" errors."
msgstr ""
"将 sys.path 指向活跃的版目录，以用户站点为后备方案。\n"
"\n"
"我们将活跃的版目录（例如 deps_dir/PIL-<ts>）添加到\n"
"sys.path 的前面，这样它们会优先被查找。我们不会删除共享的 --user\n"
"site-packages：它是一个合法的后备方案，其中 PIL/resvg 可能已经被安装\n"
"（例如之前的 `pip install --user`）。如果删除它，会破坏依赖于此方案的安装，\n"
"并导致一连串\"No module named 'PIL'\"错误。我们的 deps_dir 目录只是在其存在时覆盖它。\n"
"\n"
"关键：我们也将用户 site-packages 添加到 sys.path 中，如果它还没有的话。\n"
"Blender 不会在启动时将用户站点添加到 sys.path（ENABLE_USER_SITE 在某些构建中被设为 False，即使启用也不总是存在）。如果 PIL/resvg 已安装到用户站点（例如之前的 `pip install --user`），它们将只有在 t3dn_bip.utils 添加用户站点后才变得可见——这太晚了，在图标加载线程已经失败之后。在这里、在启动时添加它，可以防止\"No module named 'PIL'\"错误的大量出现。"

msgid ""
"True if a real, complete package is ACTIVE in deps_dir.\n"
"\n"
"Checks files on disk WITHOUT importing the module. Importing a native\n"
"package (.pyd/.so) locks the file on Windows, which then prevents pip from\n"
"overwriting it during an install/upgrade. So we only verify that the\n"
"active package folder has both __init__.py and at least one native\n"
"binary for the CURRENT platform (.pyd on Windows, .so/.dylib on\n"
"macOS/Linux). Pure-Python packages (no native binary) fall back to\n"
"requiring an extra .py module beyond __init__.py, so an empty/partial\n"
"install is never reported as installed."
msgstr ""
"如果 deps_dir 中有一个真实的、完整的包则为 True。\n"
"\n"
"检查磁盘上的文件而无需导入模块。导入原生包（.pyd/.so）会在 Windows\n"
"上锁定该文件，这会阻止 pip 在安装/升级时覆盖它。因此我们只验证\n"
"活跃的包文件夹同时包含__init__.py和至少一个当前平台的原生二进制文件\n"
"（Windows 上是.pyd，macOS/Linux 上是.so/.dylib）。纯 Python 包（没有原生二进\n"
"制文件）会回退到需要__init__.py以外的额外的.py 模块，因此空安装或部分安装从不\n"
"会被报告为已安装。"

msgid ""
"True only if the module imports as a real package (not a namespace pkg).\n"
"\n"
"NOTE: this imports the module, which locks a native .pyd on Windows. It is\n"
"only called AFTER a successful pip install (to confirm the result), never\n"
"before/during an install, so it does not block pip."
msgstr ""
"仅当模块导入为一个真实的包（而非命名空间包）时才为 True。\n"
"\n"
"注意：这会导入模块，这在 Windows 上会锁定原生.pyd。它仅在成功的 pip install\n"
"之后调用（以确认结果），从未在安装之前或期间调用，因此它不会阻止 pip。"

msgid ""
"Verify a package imports correctly, in a SEPARATE Python process.\n"
"\n"
"Returns True if the package at `folder` imports as a real module.\n"
"\n"
"We verify in a subprocess (not in Blender's process) so that importing the\n"
"new .pyd does NOT lock it inside Blender. If we imported it in-process, the\n"
".pyd would be locked and pip couldn't overwrite it later — and it would\n"
"also shadow the old module in sys.modules.\n"
"\n"
"NOTE: resvg-py ships a buggy __init__.py that raises NameError on a plain\n"
"`import resvg_py` (it does `from .resvg_py import *` then\n"
"`__doc__ = resvg_py.__doc__`, but `*` doesn't bring the `resvg_py` name).\n"
"So for resvg_py we import the native submodule directly, which is what our\n"
"sanctus_resvg wrapper does at runtime."
msgstr ""
"在一个单独的 Python 进程中验证包的导入是否正确。\n"
"\n"
"如果 `folder` 中的包能够作为真实模块导入，则返回 True。\n"
"\n"
"我们在一个子进程中（而非 Blender 的进程）进行验证，这样导入新的.pyd\n"
"就不会在 Blender 内部锁定它。如果在进程中导入，.pyd会被锁定，pip 就无法稍后覆盖它——而且它会同时覆盖 sys.modules中的旧模块。\n"
"\n"
"注意：resvg-py 分发的__init__.py有缺陷，对单纯的`import resvg_py`会抛出 NameError（它执行`from .resvg_py import *`然后`__doc__ = resvg_py.__doc__`，但*不会带入resvg_py名称）。因此对于resvg_py我们直接导入原生子模块，这正是我们的sanctus_resvg wrapper在运行时做的。"

msgid ""
"Install a pip package into a NEW versioned dir and flip the pointer.\n"
"\n"
"Returns (ok, message).\n"
"\n"
"This is the standard pipx / venv / conda pattern: we NEVER overwrite a\n"
"package in place. A native .pyd loaded by Blender is locked on Windows\n"
"(WinError 5) and cannot be replaced. Instead:\n"
"\n"
"  1. pip installs the new version into a NEW dir: <mod>-<timestamp>\n"
"  2. we verify it imports, in a SEPARATE subprocess (so we don't lock the\n"
"     new .pyd inside Blender)\n"
"  3. we atomically flip the pointer file to the new dir\n"
"  4. the OLD dir (whose .pyd is locked) stays on disk until Blender\n"
"     closes, then gets cleaned up\n"
"\n"
"No restart is needed: the very next import resolves to the new dir because\n"
"sys.path points at the active dir.\n"
"\n"
"Crash-robustness:\n"
"  - Crash mid-install: the new dir is incomplete but the pointer still\n"
"    points at the OLD working dir -> safe.\n"
"  - Active dir is corrupt: it FAILED to import, so it is NOT locked -> pip\n"
"    can overwrite it directly (we install a new dir and flip the pointer)."
msgstr ""
"将包安装到一个新的版目录中并翻转指针。\n"
"\n"
"返回(ok, message)。\n"
"\n"
"这是标准的 pipx / venv / conda 模式：我们从不原地替换包。Blender 加载的原生.pyd在Windows上被锁定（WinError 5）且无法被替换。相反：\n"
"\n"
"  1. pip 将新版本安装到一个新的目录中：<mod>-<timestamp>\n"
"  2. 我们在一个单独的子进程中验证它能导入（这样不会在 Blender 内部锁定新的.pyd）\n"
"  3. 原子性地翻转指针文件指向新目录\n"
"  4. 旧目录（其.pyd被锁定）保留在磁盘上，直到 Blender 关闭后才会被清理\n"
"\n"
"无需重启：下一次导入会解析到新版本目录，因为 sys.path 已经指向了活跃目录。\n"
"\n"
"崩溃鲁棒性：\n"
"  - 安装中途崩溃：新目录不完整但指针仍指向旧的工作目录 -> 安全。\n"
"  - 活跃目录已损坏：它导入失败，因此不会被锁定 -> pip 可以直接覆盖它（我们安装一个新目录并翻转指针）。"

msgid "Could not create install folder for {pkg}."
msgstr "无法为{pkg}创建安装目录。"

msgid "Timeout installing (pip took too long)."
msgstr "安装超时（pip 耗时过长。）"

msgid "Downloaded {pkg} but it failed to import. The current install was left untouched. Try again or check your internet connection."
msgstr "已下载 {pkg}，但导入失败。当前安装未受影响。请重试或检查网络连接。"

msgid "{pkg} updated to a new versioned install."
msgstr "{pkg} 更新为新版本安装。"

msgid ""
"Remove old version dirs for a module, keeping only the active one.\n"
"\n"
"The active dir's .pyd may be locked by Blender, so we skip it. Retired\n"
"dirs that are not locked are removed. Locked ones are left for a later\n"
"start (when Blender is closed) — _cleanup_retired is also called at\n"
"startup in cold state, so they get removed then."
msgstr ""
"删除模块的旧版本目录，保留仅激活的那个。\n"
"\n"
"激活目录的.pyd 可能被 Blender 锁定，因此我们跳过它。未被锁定的退役目录会被移除。被锁定的目录会保留到稍后启动（当 Blender 关闭时）——_cleanup_retired 也会在冷启动状态下调用，所以它们那时也会被移除。"

msgid ""
"Clean up retired version dirs in COLD state (nothing loaded yet).\n"
"\n"
"Called very early in addon startup, BEFORE any module imports PIL/resvg.\n"
"At that point the .pyd files are not loaded, so any retired version dir\n"
"that was locked by a previous Blender session can now be removed.\n"
"\n"
"With the versioned-dir pattern there is no folder swap to apply — the\n"
"pointer already points at the active dir. This function only garbage-\n"
"collects old version dirs that could not be removed while Blender was\n"
"running (their .pyd was locked)."
msgstr ""
"在 COLD 状态清理退役版本目录（此时尚未加载任何内容）。\n"
"\n"
"在插件启动的非常早期调用，在任何模块导入 PIL/resvg 之前。\n"
"\n"
"此时.pyd 文件尚未加载，因此任何由上一个 Blender 会话锁定的退役版本目录现在都可以被移除。\n"
"\n"
"使用版本化目录模式无需进行文件夹切换——指针已经指向活动目录。此函数仅清理那些在 Blender 运行时无法移除的旧版本目录（其.pyd 被锁定）。"

msgid "Install a single pip package into a new versioned dir. Returns (ok, msg)."
msgstr "将单个 pip 包安装到新版本的目录中。返回(ok, msg)。"

msgid "{pkg} already installed"
msgstr "{pkg} 已安装"

msgid "Failed to install {pkg}: {err}"
msgstr "安装 {pkg} 失败：{err}"

msgid "{pkg} installed but no package files were found in the Sanctus dependencies folder. If you're on macOS/Linux this may be a platform-detection issue — the package is probably fine."
msgstr "{pkg} 已安装，但在 Sanctus 依赖文件夹中未找到任何包文件。如果您在 macOS/Linux 上运行此问题可能是平台检测问题——该包可能没问题。"

msgid "{pkg} installed but Blender can't import it. Restart Blender and try again."
msgstr "{pkg} 已安装但 Blender 无法导入它。重启 Blender 并再次尝试。"

msgid "Successfully installed {pkg}"
msgstr "成功安装 {pkg}"

msgid ""
"Repair a broken install of `pkg` by installing a fresh versioned dir.\n"
"\n"
"Returns (ok, message). A working package has its .pyd locked by Blender\n"
"and cannot be deleted (WinError 5), so we never try to delete it. Instead\n"
"we install a NEW versioned dir and flip the pointer — the corrupt active\n"
"dir (which FAILED to import, so it is NOT locked) is simply retired and\n"
"cleaned up."
msgstr ""
"通过安装一个全新的版本目录来修复损坏的 `pkg` 安装。\n"
"\n"
"返回 (ok, message)。一个工作正常的包会被 Blender 锁定其 .pyd 文件而无法删除（WinError 5），所以我们从不尝试删除它。相反，我们安装一个新的版本目录并翻转指针 — 损坏的当前活动目录（导入失败，因此未锁）会被标记为不再使用并清理。"

msgid "{pkg} is working — nothing to repair"
msgstr "{pkg} 工作正常 —— 无需修复"

msgid "Successfully repaired {pkg}"
msgstr "成功修复了 {pkg}"

