msgid ""
"Return the active filters group, or None if it is not registered.\n"
"\n"
"The WindowManager property (``sanctus_library_sanctus_library_filters``)\n"
"is created by the auto-load register manager at addon registration. If\n"
"registration failed partway — e.g. some class fails to register on a given\n"
"platform and RegisterManager's rollback deletes this property while the\n"
"panels survive — every draw() that calls\n"
"``SanctusLibraryFilters.get_from(wm)`` would crash with AttributeError.\n"
"This helper keeps the UI alive and logs the problem once so the REAL\n"
"registration failure (printed by RegisterManager as\n"
"\"An Error occured while trying to register ...\") is what gets investigated."
msgstr ""
"返回当前过滤器组，或者未注册时返回 None。\n"
"\n"
"WindowManager 属性（``sanctus_library_sanctus_library_filters``）由自动加载注册管理器在插件注册时创建。如果注册中途失败——例如某个类在某些平台无法注册，RegisterManager 的回滚删除了该属性而面板仍然保留——那么每次调用 ``SanctusLibraryFilters.get_from(wm)`` 的 draw() 方法都会因 AttributeError 崩溃。此辅助函数保持 UI 存活并记录问题一次，从而让真正的注册失败（由 RegisterManager 打印为 \"An Error occured while trying to register ...\"）成为被调查的对象。"

