msgid "Returns tuple with first element checking if the name is a preset name and the second element returning the base name"
msgstr "返回一个元组，第一个元素检查名称是否为预设名，第二个元素返回基础名称。"

msgid "a representation of the file structure on disk. Maps directories as strings to files as Paths"
msgstr "表示磁盘上的文件结构。将目录映射为字符串，将文件映射为 Path 对象。"

msgid ""
"Re-hydrate a RawFileStructure from the build-time library manifest.\n"
"\n"
"The manifest is a nested dict mirroring the on-disk tree: category\n"
"folders map to nested dicts, and leaf folders map to lists of file\n"
"names. We re-join each file name to its parent directory (accumulated\n"
"as we recurse) so the resulting Paths are identical to what a live scan\n"
"would produce — but without globbing thousands of files at startup.\n"
"\n"
"Case-sensitivity: manifest KEYS are casefolded so runtime lookups are\n"
"case-insensitive, but builds since the fix embed the REAL on-disk\n"
"folder name under the reserved `__dirname` key of every folder node.\n"
"That real name is used when joining paths, so case-sensitive\n"
"filesystems (Linux) get the exact on-disk casing. Older manifests lack\n"
"the marker — for those, when the casefolded path does not exist we\n"
"resolve the true casing on disk via paths.resolve_case_insensitive.\n"
"\n"
"This is the \"pre-digested\" fast path used by shipped builds. It must\n"
"produce a structure byte-for-byte equivalent to RawFileStructure(root)\n"
"so the downstream pipeline (generate_assets, etc.) is unchanged."
msgstr ""
"从构建时的库清单中重新生成 RawFileStructure。\n"
"\n"
"清单是一个嵌套字典，镜像磁盘树：类别文件夹映射到嵌套字典，叶文件夹映射到文件名列表。我们将每个文件名重连到其父目录（递归时累积），因此产生的 Paths 与实时扫描生成的完全一致——但无需在启动时通配几千个文件。\n"
"\n"
"大小写敏感性：manifest KEYS 会被小写化（casefolded），以便运行时查找是大小写不敏感的，但自修复后的构建会将真实的磁盘文件夹名称嵌入每个文件夹节点的保留键 `__dirname` 下。该真实名称用于连接路径，因此区分大小的文件系统（Linux）可以获得与磁盘完全一致的格式。旧的清单缺少此标记——对于它们，当小写化路径不存在时，我们通过 paths.resolve_case_insensitive 在磁盘上解析正确的格式。\n"
"\n"
"这是已发布构建使用的“预消化”快速路径。它必须生成逐字节等效于 RawFileStructure(root) 的结构，因此下游管道（generate_assets 等）保持不变。"

