msgid ""
"Return the best icon file for the HUD.\n"
"\n"
"Defaults to BIP (fast, uncompressed, single-file) and falls back to\n"
"JPG/PNG when no BIP exists. The HUD loader (load_gpu_texture) decodes\n"
"BIP via t3dn_bip and loads JPG/PNG natively. Returns None only when\n"
"the asset has no icons at all.\n"
"\n"
"icon_files may interleave BIP/JPG per preset (e.g. [stone_01.bip,\n"
"stone_01.jpg, stone_02.bip, stone_02.jpg, ...]), so we resolve the\n"
"preset by NAME (preset_names[preset]) and pick the matching BIP —\n"
"never a different preset's file."
msgstr ""
"返回 HUD 的最佳图标文件。\n"
"\n"
"默认为 BIP（快速、未压缩的单文件），如果没有 BIP，则回退到 JPG/PNG。HUD 加载器 (load_gpu_texture) 通过 t3dn_bip 解码 BIP，并原生加载 JPG/PNG。仅在资产完全没有图标时返回 None。\n"
"\n"
"icon_files 可能按预设交错 BIP/JPG（例如 [stone_01.bip, stone_01.jpg, stone_02.bip, stone_02.jpg, ...]），因此我们通过名称（preset_names[preset]）解析预设，并选择匹配的 BIP——永远不会使用不同预设的文件。"

