msgid ""
"Create the font cache dir, falling back to bpy.app.tempdir on failure.\n"
"\n"
"A permission error here must NEVER abort addon registration. If the native\n"
"addon scripts dir is read-only (common on macOS managed installs), we fall\n"
"back to the session temp dir so font previews still work for the session."
msgstr ""
"创建字体缓存目录，失败时回退到 bpy.app.tempdir。\n"
