"此处必须永远不要因权限错误而中断插件注册。如果原生插件脚本目录是只读的（macOS 管理安装时很常见），我们回退到会话临时目录，以便会话中的字体预览仍正常工作。"

msgid ""
"Deep Cleans the asset (removes junk properties) and injects Source Metadata + Signature.\n"
"Recursively processes NodeTrees to ensure deep authorship tagging.\n"
"\n"
"CRITICAL SAFETY: Pre-existing node groups (those already in bpy.data.node_groups\n"
"before this call) are NEVER touched. Only newly imported datablocks are cleaned.\n"
"This prevents destroying linked libraries like Blender 5.1's geometry_nodes_essentials.blend."
msgstr ""
"深度清理资产（移除无用属性）并注入来源元数据 + 签名。\n"
"递归处理节点树以确保进行深度的作者归属标记。\n"
"\n"
"关键安全：在此调用之前已存在于 bpy.data.node_groups 中的现有节点组将绝不会被触碰。仅清理新导入的数据块。这防止了破坏如 Blender 5.1 的 geometry_nodes_essentials.blend 这样链接的库."

