msgstr ""
"Persistent favorites file outside the addon, so reinstalls don't wipe it.\n"
"写入持久的 JSON 文件，因此重装不会清除收藏夹。|||~|||Write the current favorites dict to the persistent JSON file.\n"
"将当前的收藏夹字典写入持久的 JSON 文件。|||~|||Restore favorites from the file when the addon prefs were wiped.\n"
"当插件偏好设置被清除时，从文件中恢复收藏夹。|||~|||Only fills an EMPTY in-addon dict (never overwrites"

msgid "Persistent favorites file outside the addon, so reinstalls don't wipe it."
msgstr ""
"existing data — that would fight a live session where the user just removed favorites).\n"
"仅在内建插件字典中填充空数据（绝不会覆盖现有数据——这会与用户刚刚移除收藏夹的实时会话冲突）。|||~|||Returns True when favorites were restored, False otherwise.\n"
"收藏夹恢复成功返回 True，否则返回 False。|||~|||Restore favorites from the backup file into the preferences dict.\n"
"将收藏夹从备份文件恢复到偏好设置字典中。|||~|||SAFE TO CALL ANYW"

msgid "Write the current favorites dict to the persistent JSON file."
msgstr ""
"HERE (including inside register()): only touches the preferences dict — it does NOT rebuild the runtime hierarchy or touch bpy classes.\n"
"可在任何地方安全调用（包括在 register() 内部）：仅操作偏好设置字典——它不会重建运行时层级或接触 bpy 类。|||~|||If favorites were restored AND the library is already loaded, schedules the hierarchy/HUD refresh via a one-shot timer (runs OUTSIDE register"

msgid ""
"Restore favorites from the file when the addon prefs were wiped.\n"
"\n"
"Only fills an EMPTY in-addon dict (never overwrites existing data —\n"
"that would fight a live session where the user just removed favorites).\n"
"\n"
"Returns True when favorites were restored, False otherwise."
msgstr ""
"(), so it's safe even when called from register() during a hot reload).\n"
"如果收藏夹已恢复且库已经加载，则通过一个一次性定时器调度层级/HUD 刷新（在 register() 外部运行，因此即使在热重载期间从 register() 调用也安全）。|||~|||Returns True if favorites were restored.\n"
"若收藏夹被恢复则返回 True。|||~|||Full refresh AFTER prefs are available (load_post context, safe).\n"
"prefs 可用之后进行完整刷新（load_post 上下文，安全）。|||~|||Rebuilds"

msgid ""
"Restore favorites from the backup file into the preferences dict.\n"
"\n"
"SAFE TO CALL ANYWHERE (including inside register()): only touches the\n"
"preferences dict — it does NOT rebuild the runtime hierarchy or touch\n"
"bpy classes.\n"
"\n"
"If favorites were restored AND the library is already loaded, schedules\n"
"the hierarchy/HUD refresh via a one-shot timer (runs OUTSIDE register(),\n"
"so it's safe even when called from register() during a hot reload).\n"
"\n"
"Returns True if favorites were restored."
msgstr ""
"the \"My Favorites\" hierarchy and wakes the HUD so restored favorites show up. Never call this inside register().\n"
"重建“我的收藏”层级并唤醒 HUD，使已恢复的收藏夹显示出来。切勿在 register() 内部调用此函数。|||~|||Idempotent & cheap when there is nothing to do: with no favorites in the prefs dict it returns immediately (nothing to rebuild).\n"
"当无需做任何事时是幂等的且开销极小：如果 prefs 字典中没有收藏夹则立即返回（无可重建设）。"

msgid ""
"Full refresh AFTER prefs are available (load_post context, safe).\n"
"\n"
"Rebuilds the \"My Favorites\" hierarchy and wakes the HUD so restored\n"
"favorites show up. Never call this inside register().\n"
"\n"
"Idempotent & cheap when there is nothing to do: with no favorites in the\n"
"prefs dict it returns immediately (nothing to rebuild)."
msgstr ""
"|||~|||load_post handler: restore favorites + refresh after prefs load.\n"
"load_post 处理器：加载偏好设置后恢复收藏夹并刷新界面。|||~|||Timing note: the library hierarchy (\"My Favorites\") is built during manager.register(True), when addon preferences are still None — so it never contains favorites. Blender restores the real preferences only after the first frame. By t"

msgid ""
"load_post handler: restore favorites + refresh after prefs load.\n"
"\n"
"Timing note: the library hierarchy (\"My Favorites\") is built during\n"
"manager.register(True), when addon preferences are still None — so it\n"
"never contains favorites. Blender restores the real preferences only\n"
"after the first frame. By the time this timer runs, preferences ARE\n"
"available, so we:\n"
"  1. restore from the backup file if the dict is empty (reinstall case);\n"
"  2. ALWAYS refresh the hierarchy/HUD when favorites exist — regardless\n"
"     of whether they came from the backup or from Blender's own\n"
"     userpref restore (the hierarchy was built without them either way)."
msgstr ""
"he time this timer runs, preferences ARE available, so we:\n"
"  1. restore from the backup file if the dict is empty (reinstall case);\n"
"  2. ALWAYS refresh the hierarchy/HUD when favorites exist — regardless of whether they came from the backup or from Blender's own userpref restore (the hierarchy was built without them either way).\n"
"说明：库层级（“我的收藏”）"

msgid "Register the load_post handler once (idempotent)."
msgstr ""
"是在 manager.register(True) 期间构建的，此时插件偏好设置仍为 None——因此它从不包含收藏夹。Blender 直到第一帧后才恢复真实的偏好设置。当此定时器运行时，偏好设置已经可用了，所以我们：\n"
"  1. 如果字典为空则从备份文件中恢复（重装场景）；\n"
"  2. 只要有收藏夹存在就 ALWAYS 刷新层级/HUD——无论收藏夹来自备份还是来自 Blender 自身的用户偏好恢复（层级无论如何都不会包含它们）。|||~|||Register the load_post handler once (idempotent).\n"
"仅注册一次 load_post 处理器（幂等）。|||~|||Print a full favorites-persistence diagn"

