"    if mod:\n"
"        sys.modules[mod[0]].diagnostic_favorites()\n"
"    else:\n"
"        print('library_manager not loaded')\n"
"\n"
"Shows: prefs module, current favorites count, backup path + existence,\n"
"backup contents, and whether the load_post handler is registered."
msgstr ""
"ostic (paste in Blender console).\n"
"打印完整的收藏夹持久性诊断信息（粘贴到 Blender 控制台）。|||~|||IMPORTANT: do NOT import this module from the console — that re-runs register() and can hang Blender. Instead, get the ALREADY-LOADED module:\n"
"\n"
"    import sys\n"
"    mod = [m for m in sys.modules if m.endswith('library_manager')]\n"
"    if mod:\n"
"        sys.modules[mod[0]].diagn"

msgid "Bulletproof single thumbnail update with instant RAM overlay"
msgstr ""
