"    else:\n"
"        print('library_manager not loaded')\n"
"重要提示：切勿从控制台导入此模块——那会重新运行 register() 并可能导致 Blender 卡死。相反，获取已经加载的模块即可。|||~|||Shows: prefs module, current favorites count, backup path + existence,\n"
"backup contents, and whether the load_post handler is registered.\n"
"显示：prefs 模块、当前收藏夹数量、备份路径及是否存在、备份内容以及 load_post 处理器是否已注册。"

msgid "Updates the list of favorites in RAM without touching the Blender WindowManager (Zero Lag)"
msgstr "将内存中的收藏夹列表更新，同时不触碰 Blender WindowManager（零延迟）"

msgid "My Favorites"
msgstr "我的收藏夹"

msgid ""
"Hydrate a RawFileStructure from a library_manifest.json, or None if invalid.\n"
"\n"
"Shared by the core library and expansions. The manifest's `structure` is\n"
"always relative to `asset_root` (the folder the caller would otherwise scan),\n"
"so the hydrated structure is byte-for-byte equivalent to a live scan.\n"
"\n"
"Returns None if the manifest is absent, corrupt, or has no usable structure —\n"
"in which case the caller falls back to a live scan."
msgstr ""
"从 library_manifest.json 加载 RawFileStructure，如果无效则返回 None。\n"
"\n"
"由核心库和扩展包共享。manifest 的 `structure` 相对于 `asset_root`（调用者否则要扫描的文件夹）始终是相对的，因此填充后的结构在字节级别完全等价于实时扫描的结果。\n"
"\n"
"如果 manifest 不存在、损坏或没有可用的 structure，则返回 None —— 在这种情况下，调用者会回退到实时扫描。"

msgid ""
"Try to load the pre-digested core library manifest (shipped builds).\n"
"\n"
"Returns a RawFileStructure hydrated from library_manifest.json, or None if\n"
"the manifest is absent, stale (version mismatch), or corrupt. In all those\n"
"cases the caller falls back to a live scan.\n"
"\n"
"The manifest is generated at build time from the FINAL packed layout, so it\n"
"already reflects the lib-sl -> lib rename and starter filtering. It only\n"
"covers the static core library (lib/); lib-common support files, expansions,\n"
"dev paths, and the runtime font cache are added separately by the caller."
msgstr ""
"尝试加载预消化的核心库清单（随分发构建捆绑）。\n"
"\n"
"从 library_manifest.json 填充并返回 RawFileStructure，或者在 manifest 缺失、过期（版本不匹配）或损坏时返回 None。在所有这些情况下，调用者都会回退到实时扫描。\n"
"\n"
"该清单是在构建时间从最终打包布局生成的，因此它已经反映了 lib-sl -> lib 的重命名和 starter 过滤。它只覆盖静态核心库 (lib/)；lib-common 支持文件、扩展包、开发路径以及运行时字体缓存则由调用者单独添加。"

msgid ""
"Add the runtime-only parts of the structure that are NOT in the manifest.\n"
"\n"
"These are genuinely dynamic and must always be computed at runtime:\n"
"  - forge fonts (lib-common/forge/inputs/fonts)\n"
"  - support-files (lib-common/support-files)\n"
"  - user-installed expansions"
msgstr ""
"添加不在 manifest 中的结构部分（仅运行时）。\n"
"\n"
"这些确实是动态的，必须在运行时计算：\n"
"  - forge 字体 (lib-common/forge/inputs/fonts)\n"
"  - 支持文件 (lib-common/support-files)\n"
"  - 用户安装的扩展包"

msgid ""
"Detect expansion packs installed as Blender extensions and load their assets.\n"
"\n"
"Scans bpy.context.preferences.extensions repos for known expansion extension IDs\n"
"defined in Config.EXPANSION_EXTENSION_IDS. When found, loads the assets from\n"
"the extension's directory into the library manager.\n"
"\n"
"Uses repo.directory (the actual filesystem path of each extension repo) to locate\n"
"installed extensions, which is the correct approach for Blender 4.5+.\n"
"\n"
"Only loads assets from expansions that are currently enabled (via sentinel files)."
msgstr ""
"检测作为 Blender 扩展安装的扩展包并加载其资产。\n"
"\n"
"扫描 bpy.context.preferences.extensions 中的已知扩展扩展 ID（在 Config.EXPANSION_EXTENSION_IDS 中定义）。找到后，从扩展的目录加载资产到库管理器。\n"
"\n"
"使用 repo.directory（每个扩展仓库的实际文件系统路径）来定位已安装的扩展，这是 Blender 4.5+ 的正确方法。\n"
"\n"
"只加载当前启用的扩展中的资产（通过哨兵文件控制）。"

msgid ""
"Return {expansion_root_dir: expansion overlay icon} for installed expansions.\n"
"\n"
"Only enabled expansions (Expansion Mode + active) are considered.\n"
"\n"
"The overlay is a 250x250 transparent image with the logo pre-positioned\n"
"in the bottom-left corner, applied as a direct alpha-composite. Lookup\n"
"order:\n"
"  1. icons/expansion_overlay.bip — the \"solo BIP\" build converts the PNG\n"
"     to BIP and drops the PNG, so installed builds only have the BIP.\n"
"  2. icons/expansion_overlay.png — the editable source (dev tree).\n"
"If NEITHER exists, the expansion is OLD — no overlay at all (the legacy\n"
"expansion.png is a centered/full logo that would cover the whole\n"
"thumbnail, so it must never be used as an overlay).\n"
"\n"
"Clones (e.g. Sanctus Viz) keep their assets inside an asset_subfolder\n"
"(\"lib\"), which is the equivalent of the ROOT of a normal expansion. The\n"
"icon lookup and the returned directory key use that root, so the asset\n"
"overlay matching works for clones too."
msgstr ""
"返回 {expansion_root_dir: expansion overlay icon}，对应已安装的扩展。\n"
"\n"
"仅考虑已启用的扩展（扩展模式 + 激活状态）。\n"
"\n"
"叠加层是带有预先定位在左下角的图标的 250x250 透明图像，以直接 alpha 合成方式应用。查找顺序：\n"
"  1. icons/expansion_overlay.bip — \"solo BIP\" 构建会将 PNG 转换为 BIP 并丢弃 PNG，因此已安装的构建只有 BIP。\n"
"  2. icons/expansion_overlay.png — 可编辑源（开发树）。\n"
"如果两者都不存在，扩展包是旧的 —— 根本没有叠加层（legacy expansion.png 是一个居中的完整图标，会覆盖整个缩略图，因此绝不能用作叠加层）。\n"
"\n"
"克隆包（例如 Sanctus Viz）将其资产保留在 asset_subfolder (\"lib\") 中，这相当于正常扩展包的 ROOT。图标查找和返回的目录键使用此根目录，因此资产叠加匹配对克隆包也有效。"

msgid ""
"Build MANAGER.expansion_icon_map (icon_key -> expansion overlay file).\n"
"\n"
"MUST run in a SAFE context (the process_loaded_images timer), never\n"
"during addon registration / Blender startup — it accesses\n"
"bpy.context.preferences (extensions repos), which can hang Blender if\n"
"called before preferences are fully restored.\n"
"\n"
"RETRY SEMANTICS (fixed the \"empty map cached forever\" bug):\n"
"The map is NOT cached until it has at least one entry. If no expansions\n"
"are detected yet (the timer can fire before Blender finishes loading\n"
"extensions) or no expansion asset matched yet (library scan still in\n"
"progress), _expansion_icon_map_built stays False and the next tick\n"
"retries. Once built with entries, it is cached until invalidated by\n"
"generate_image_file_list() (sets _expansion_icon_map_built = False)."
msgstr ""
"构建 MANAGER.expansion_icon_map（icon_key -> expansion overlay file）。\n"
"\n"
"必须在 SAFE 上下文中运行（process_loaded_images 定时器），绝不能在与附加组件注册或 Blender 启动期间运行 —— 它会访问 bpy.context.preferences（扩展库/仓库），如果在偏好设置完全恢复之前调用可能会挂起 Blender。\n"
"\n"
"重试语义（修复了\"空映射永久缓存”的 bug）：\n"
"该映射只有在至少有一个条目时才会被缓存。如果尚未检测到任何扩展（定时器可能在 Blender 完成加载扩展之前就触发）或尚未匹配任何扩展资产（库扫描仍在进行中），_expansion_icon_map_built 保持 False，下一轮将重试。一旦带条目构建成功，它将直到被 generate_image_file_list() 使失效（设置 _expansion_icon_map_built = False）。"

msgid ""
"Queue the next batch of thumbnails. Returns True when all are queued.\n"
"\n"
"Called by the deferred build timer. Processes at most _THUMBNAILS_PER_TICK\n"
"images per tick so the main thread never does thousands of previews.new()\n"
"calls in a single frame."
msgstr ""
"安排下一批缩略图。返回 True 表示所有已排队。\n"
"\n"
"由 deferred build timer 调用。每个 tick 最多处理 _THUMBNAILS_PER_TICK 个图像，因此主线程不会在单个帧中执行数千次 previews.new() 调用。"

msgid "Sanctus Assets"
msgstr "Sanctus Assets"

msgid ""
"Return the ordered stages of a full library build.\n"
"\n"
"Each stage is a single callable that mutates MANAGER. The deferred build\n"
"runs one stage per timer tick; reload_library() runs them all synchronously."
msgstr ""
"返回库的完整构建流程的各个阶段。\n"
"\n"
"每个阶段都是单个可调用对象，会修改 MANAGER。延迟构建会在每个定时器周期运行一个阶段；reload_library() 则会同步执行所有阶段."

msgid ""
"Run the full build synchronously.\n"
"\n"
"Never raises: on failure it enters degraded mode (MANAGER.loaded stays\n"
"False) so the addon stays registered and the UI can show a Retry banner."
msgstr ""
"同步运行整个构建过程。\n"
"\n"
"不会抛出异常：在失败时进入降级模式（MANAGER.loaded 保持为 False），因此插件仍然注册，UI 可以显示重试横幅。"

msgid "Create the empty MANAGER shell (no heavy work). Safe to call in register()."
msgstr "创建空的 MANAGER 外壳（不做繁重工作）。可以在 register() 中安全调用。"

msgid "Tear down the library (full or partial). Idempotent + degraded-safe."
msgstr "拆除库（完整或部分）。可幂等 + 降级安全。"

msgid "Kick off the chunked build. Idempotent — safe to call multiple times."
msgstr "启动分块构建。可幂等——可以多次调用。"

msgid ""
"Kick off the deferred build once the main loop is running.\n"
"\n"
"Timers only fire AFTER Blender finishes registering every extension, so by\n"
"the time this runs, detect_installed_expansions() can see the expansion\n"
"extensions in bpy.context.preferences.addons. This is what fixes expansions\n"
"\"disappearing\" after a restart."
msgstr ""
"启动延迟构建，等待主循环运行后执行。\n"
"\n"
"定时器仅在 Blender 完成所有扩展的注册后才触发，因此当此阶段运行时，detect_installed_expansions() 可以在 bpy.context.preferences.addons 中看到已安装的扩展模块。这就是为什么重启后\"消失\"的扩展会重新显示的原因。"

msgid "Advance the deferred build by one stage per timer tick."
msgstr "在延迟构建中推进一个阶段（每个定时器周期一个）。"

msgid "Cancel any in-flight deferred build (timer + state)."
msgstr "取消任何正在进行的延迟构建（定时器 + 状态）。"

msgid "Synchronous full rebuild (user-initiated \"Reload Library\")."
msgstr "同步完整重建（用户发起的“重载库”操作）。"

