msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Auto-Fill Descriptions"
msgstr ""
"自动填充描述 || ~ || 全部设置为单个\n"
"Sanctus Core 统一化的文件系统路径辅助工具。\n"
"\n"
"每个将 *逻辑* 库路径（不区分大小写的清单键）转换为 *实际* 磁盘路径的地方，都应经过本模块。它是唯一权威的数据源：\n"
"\n"
"- `RawFileStructure` 键是小写化处理的（不区分大小写的查找层）\n"
"- `Raw"

msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Set All to Single"
msgstr ""
"FileStructure` 值是真实的 `pathlib.Path` 对象（真正的字母顺序）\n"
"- 清单文件夹节点携带 `__dirname`（磁盘上的确切文件夹名，由构建器在修复大小写问题后记录）\n"
"- 文件系统现实：Windows 和默认 macOS 是不区分大小写的；Linux（以及以区分大小写 APFS 格式化的 ma"

msgid ""
"Centralized filesystem-path helpers for Sanctus Core.\n"
"\n"
"Every place that turns a *logical* library path (casefolded manifest keys,\n"
"case-insensitive lookups) into a *real* on-disk path should go through this\n"
"module. It is the single authority that knows:\n"
"\n"
"  - `RawFileStructure` KEYS are casefolded (case-insensitive lookup layer)\n"
"  - `RawFileStructure` VALUES are real `pathlib.Path` objects (true casing)\n"
"  - Manifest folder nodes carry `__dirname` (the exact on-disk folder name,\n"
"    recorded by the builder since the case-sensitivity fix)\n"
"  - Filesystem reality: Windows and default macOS are case-INSENSITIVE,\n"
"    Linux (and a macOS volume formatted as case-sensitive APFS) is NOT\n"
"  - Separators are normalized by pathlib — never build paths by string\n"
"    concatenation (mixing \"/\" and \"\\\" only ever causes pain)\n"
"\n"
"Defense-in-depth: even if a caller builds a path with the wrong casing, the\n"
"resolvers below recover the real file/dir on case-sensitive filesystems."
msgstr ""
"cOS 卷）则不是\n"
"- 分隔符由 pathlib 标准化——永远不要通过字符串拼接来构建路径（混合 \"/\" 和 \"\\\" 只会带来麻烦）\n"
"\n"
"纵深防御：即使调用方构建了错误大小写的路径，下面的解析器也会在区分大小写的文件系统中恢复真实的文件或目录。|| ~ || 返回父级中名称小写化为 `name` 的条目。\n"
"\n"
"保留磁盘上的真实"

msgid ""
"Return the entry inside `parent` whose name casefolds to `name`.\n"
"\n"
"Preserves the real on-disk casing (essential on case-sensitive\n"
"filesystems). Returns None when there is no match or the directory is\n"
"unreadable. Only called when an exact join failed, so the common fast\n"
"path never pays the iterdir() cost."
msgstr ""
"字母顺序（在区分大小写的文件系统上至关重要）。当找不到匹配项或目录无法读取时返回 None。仅在精确拼接失败后调用，因此快速路径无需付出 iterdir() 的成本。|| ~ || 将 `path` 解析为其实际的磁盘路径，容忍错误的大小写。\n"
"\n"
"从锚点开始向下遍历每个部分，不区分大小写地将其与应存放的目录进行匹配，返回精确字母顺序的 Path 对象。"

msgid ""
"Resolve `path` to its real on-disk path, tolerating wrong casing.\n"
"\n"
"Walks every part from the anchor downward, matching each part\n"
"case-insensitively against the directory it should live in, and returns\n"
"the exact-cased Path. Returns None if any part cannot be matched or the\n"
"path is not absolute.\n"
"\n"
"This is the safety net for paths built from casefolded manifest keys on\n"
"case-sensitive filesystems (Linux). For correctly-built paths it is an\n"
"early return (one exists() check)."
msgstr ""
"如果任何部分无法匹配或路径不是绝对的，则返回 None。\n"
"\n"
"这是为在区分大小写的文件系统（Linux）上构建自不区分大小写清单键的路径提供的安全网。对于正确构建的路径它是一个早期返回（一次 exists() 检查）。|| ~ || 返回一个实际存在于磁盘上的文件路径字符串。\n"
"\n"
"如果 `filepath` 已存在则原样返回。否"

msgid ""
"Return a filepath string that actually exists on disk.\n"
"\n"
"If `filepath` exists as-is it is returned unchanged. Otherwise the path\n"
"is resolved case-insensitively part-by-part (Linux-safe) and the real\n"
"casing is returned. If nothing matches, the ORIGINAL string is returned\n"
"so error messages still reference what the caller asked for.\n"
"\n"
"Use at read boundaries (preview loading, BIP decode, image load) so a\n"
"wrong-cased path degrades gracefully instead of failing."
msgstr ""
"则按部分逐个不区分大小写地解析该路径（Linux 安全），并返回真实的字母顺序。如果没有匹配项，则返回原始字符串，以便错误消息仍然引用调用方请求的内容。\n"
"\n"
"在读取边界处使用（预览加载、BIP 解码、图像加载）——这样错误的字母顺序路径会优雅降级而不是失败。|| ~ || 将清单文件夹节点拼接到其真实目录路径。\n"
"\n"
"`marke"

msgid ""
"Join a manifest folder node to its real directory path.\n"
"\n"
"`marker` is the node's `__dirname` value — the exact on-disk folder name\n"
"recorded by the builder — or None. Newer manifests always carry it, so\n"
"the join is exact and costs no filesystem IO. Older manifests lack it:\n"
"the (casefolded) key is used and, if the join does not exist on a\n"
"case-sensitive filesystem, the real casing is resolved on disk.\n"
"\n"
"Used by RawFileStructure.from_manifest so hydrated file Paths always\n"
"carry the true on-disk casing — the root cause of the Linux BIP\n"
"\"File not found\" bug."
msgstr ""
"r` 是节点的 `__dirname` 值——由构建器记录的磁盘上的确切文件夹名，或为 None。较新的清单总是携带它，因此拼接是精确的且无需文件系统 I/O。较旧的清单缺少它：使用（小写化）键并在区分大小写的文件系统中找不到拼接结果时，会在磁盘上解析真实的字母顺序。\n"
"\n"
"由 RawFileStructure.from_manifest 调用，"

msgid ""
"Manages the preferences UI. Currently, all of the user preferences get saved to and loaded from an external file. I am not sure if that is super necessary...\n"
"But it is also possible to export and import preferences in a similar fashion as the user."
msgstr ""
"使得水合后的文件路径始终携带真正的磁盘字母顺序——这正是 Linux BIP \"文件未找到\" 错误的根本原因。|| ~ || 管理首选项 UI。目前，所有用户首选项都保存到外部文件中加载。我不确定这是否真的必要……\n"
"但也可能以与用户导入/导出相似的方式导出和导入首选项。|| ~ || 仅当模块是真正的完整包时返回 True。"

msgid ""
"Return True only if a module is a REAL, complete package.\n"
"\n"
"A namespace package (e.g. an empty folder left behind by a failed pip\n"
"install) imports without raising ImportError, but has __file__ = None and\n"
"__spec__.origin = None. We must treat those as NOT installed so the\n"
"Install Dependencies operator actually reinstalls them."
msgstr ""
"命名空间包（例如因 pip 安装失败而遗留的空文件夹）会导入但不抛出 ImportError，但其 __file__ = None 且 __spec__.origin = None。我们必须将其视为未安装，以便“安装依赖项”操作符能真正重新安装它们。|| ~ || 刷新依赖项状态。安全地可在 draw() 或安装后调用。\n"
"\n"
"通过实际导入模块来验证，"

msgid ""
"Refresh dependency status. Safe to call from draw() or after install.\n"
"\n"
"Verifies by ACTUALLY importing the modules so we detect real usability\n"
"(a folder with files can still be a broken install). Importing a native\n"
".pyd locks the file on Windows, but that only matters when we then try to\n"
"overwrite it with pip. A package that fails to import is NOT locked, so it\n"
"can still be repaired. A package that imports fine is locked, but it also\n"
"doesn't need repairing."
msgstr "因此我们能检测真正的可用性（包含文件的文件夹仍然可能是损坏的安装）。导入原生.pyd 文件会在 Windows 上锁定该文件，但这仅在我们随后尝试用 pip 覆盖它时才有意义。无法导入的包不会被锁定，因此仍可进行修复。能正常导入的包已被锁定，但也无需修复。"

msgid "stores a path to a library outside of the main addon library. Users are able to load their own images as decals and as of recently users can install expansion packs"
msgstr "存储外部库的路径（不在主插件库内）。用户可以加载自己的图像作为贴图，并且最近用户还可以安装扩展包"

