msgid ""
"When expansion_mode toggles, mark assets for reload.\n"
"\n"
"NOTE: The sentinel write/remove is handled by the property's `set`\n"
"callback (_set_expansion_mode), which runs before this update. Here we\n"
"only invalidate the library cache so Sanctus Library re-scans on the\n"
"next reload. Toggling requires a Blender restart to take effect for\n"
"the panels/keymaps/operators (suppressed only at register() time), but\n"
"the sentinel is updated immediately so Sanctus Library sees the change."
msgstr ""
"当扩展模式切换时，标记资产以便重载。\n"
"\n"
"注意：哨兵写入/移除由属性的 `set` 回调（_set_expansion_mode）处理，该回调在调用本文更新之前运行。这里我们仅使库缓存失效，以便 Sanctus 库在下一次重载时重新扫描。切换扩展模式需要在 Blender 重启后才能对面板、键盘映射和操作符生效（注册时仍被抑制），但哨兵会立即更新，这样 Sanctus 库就能看到更改。"

