msgid ""
"Robust wrapper around the `resvg-py` package.\n"
"\n"
"The `resvg-py` package (v0.4.0) ships a buggy `__init__.py`:\n"
"\n"
"    from .resvg_py import *\n"
"    __doc__ = resvg_py.__doc__\n"
"\n"
"`from .resvg_py import *` only imports the names listed in the submodule's\n"
"`__all__` (which does NOT include `resvg_py` itself), so the second line raises\n"
"`NameError: name 'resvg_py' is not defined` whenever the package is re-imported\n"
"after being dropped from `sys.modules` (which our dependency checker does).\n"
"\n"
"Importing the native submodule directly (`resvg_py.resvg_py`) works reliably\n"
"even when the package `__init__.py` is broken, because the submodule is loaded\n"
"independently. This wrapper centralises that workaround so the rest of Sanctus\n"
"never has to `import resvg_py` directly."
msgstr ""
"围绕 `resvg-py` 包构建的健壮封装。\n"
"\n"
"`resvg-py` 包（v0.4.0）附带一个有缺陷的 `__init__.py`:\n"
"\n"
"    from .resvg_py import *\n"
"    __doc__ = resvg_py.__doc__\n"
"\n"
"`from .resvg_py import *` 仅导入子模块中列在 `__all__`中的名称（它不包括 `resvg_py` 本身），因此第二行会在包从 `sys.modules`被移除后重新导入时抛出 `NameError: name 'resvg_py' is not defined`错误。\n"
"\n"
"直接导入原生子模块（`resvg_py.resvg_py`）即使包`__init__.py`损坏也能可靠工作，因为子模块独立加载。该封装将此变通方案集中化，这样 Sanctus 的其他部分无需直接 `import resvg_py`。"

