msgid ""
"Remove module cache of entire package and subpackages of an addon.\n"
"\n"
"CRITICAL: modules that load NATIVE dependencies (.pyd / DLLs) must NOT be\n"
"purged. Re-importing them forces Windows to reload the .pyd, which is very\n"
"slow and causes progressive memory fragmentation across reload cycles\n"
"(observed: preferences.py grew from 48ms to 4714ms, developer_tools from\n"
"48ms to 18367ms). These modules are kept in sys.modules so their native\n"
"deps stay loaded:\n"
"  - preferences  (runs _check_dependencies() at import → pops+reloads resvg_py .pyd)\n"
"  - deps         (dependency installer, manipulates sys.modules)\n"
"  - sanctus_resvg (wrapper around the resvg_py native .pyd)\n"
"  - t3dn_bip     (thumbnail loader, imports PIL)"
msgstr ""
"移除整个包及插件子包的模块缓存。\n"
"\n"
"⚠️ 警告：加载 NATIVE 依赖（.pyd / DLL）的模块不得被清除。重新导入它们会强制 Windows 重新加载 .pyd，这非常慢并会导致跨重载循环产生渐进式内存碎片（观察到 preferences.py 从 48ms 增长到 4714ms，developer_tools 从 48ms 增长到 18367ms）。这些模块保留在 sys.modules 中以便其原生依赖保持加载状态：\n"
"  - preferences（导入时运行 _check_dependencies() → 触发 resvg_py .pyd 的弹出+重新加载）\n"
"  - deps（依赖安装器，操作 sys.modules）\n"
"  - sanctus_resvg（resvg_py 原生 .pyd 的包装器）\n"
"  - t3dn_bip（缩略图加载器，导入 PIL）"

