msgid ""
"Remove stale keymap items from the addon keyconfig only.\n"
"\n"
"keyconfigs.addon exists in all Blender versions (2.80+). It is an\n"
"isolated keyconfig that Blender manages separately from the user's\n"
"keyconfig — it's safe to purge items there because they are\n"
"auto-generated by the addon.\n"
"\n"
"We NEVER touch keyconfigs.user because that would delete the user's\n"
"personal keymap customizations.\n"
"\n"
"If `names` is provided, only items whose .name matches one of the\n"
"given names will be removed (in addition to matching bl_idname).\n"
"This prevents purging keymap items from other addons that share\n"
"the same operator (e.g. wm.call_panel).\n"
"\n"
"Call this BEFORE registering new shortcuts to ensure a clean slate\n"
"in the addon keyconfig."
msgstr ""
"仅从附加插件的键位配置中清除过时的键位项。\n"
"\n"
"keyconfigs.addon 在所有 Blender 版本（2.80+）中都存在。它是 Blender 独立于用户键位配置管理的隔离键位配置——可以安全地从中清除项目，因为它们是由附加插件自动生成的。\n"
"\n"
"我们绝不会触碰 keyconfigs.user，否则将删除用户的个人键位自定义设置。\n"
"\n"
"如果提供了 `names` 参数，则只移除 .name 与给定名称匹配的项目（除了同时匹配 bl_idname）。\n"
"这样可以避免清除其他附加插件中共享同一操作符的键位项（例如 wm.call_panel）。\n"
"\n"
"在注册新快捷键之前调用此函数，以确保附加插件键位配置中的初始状态干净。"

