msgid ""
"Detect expansions that are ACTUALLY loaded by Blender.\n"
"\n"
"Source of truth: bpy.context.preferences.addons — Blender only lists\n"
"extensions it has loaded and activated there. No disk scanning, no\n"
"tomllib parsing of every repo, no repo crawling: if Blender didn't load\n"
"it, it does not exist for this session. This eliminates:\n"
"  - false positives from orphaned folders left on disk (uninstalled /\n"
"    disabled copies),\n"
"  - the multi-repo mess (the same extension in user_default AND a\n"
"    remote repo) — Blender loads exactly ONE instance and reports it\n"
"    in preferences.addons,\n"
"  - startup hangs from scanning every repo's filesystem during addon\n"
"    registration.\n"
"\n"
"Args:\n"
"    only_enabled: when True, also require the expansion to be in\n"
"        Expansion Mode (persistent sentinel) — see expansion_tracker.\n"
"\n"
"Returns: { extension_id: { name, version, folder, source_repo,\n"
"                            package_name, package_path, manifest_path,\n"
"                            enabled, asset_subfolder } }"
msgstr ""
"检测 Blender 实际加载的扩展。\n"
"\n"
"真相来源：bpy.context.preferences.addons — Blender 只在此处列出已加载并启用的扩展。它不进行磁盘扫描，不解析每个仓库的 tomllib，也不爬取仓库：如果 Blender 没有加载它，那么在本次会话中该扩展就不存在。这消除了以下问题：\n"
"  - 由磁盘上遗留的孤儿文件夹导致的误报（未安装/已禁用的副本），\n"
"  - 多仓库混乱（同一个扩展存在于 user_default 和远程仓库）——Blender 精确地只加载一个实例，并在 preferences.addons 中报告它，\n"
"  - addon 注册期间扫描每个仓库文件系统导致的启动挂起。\n"
"\n"
"参数：\n"
"    only_enabled: 当为 True 时，还需要该扩展处于 扩展模式（持久化哨兵）——参见 expansion_tracker。\n"
"\n"
"返回：{ extension_id: { name, version, folder, source_repo, package_name, package_path, manifest_path, enabled, asset_subfolder } }"

msgid ""
"Expansion Tracker — Sentinel file mechanism for enabled/disabled detection.\n"
"\n"
"Each expansion writes a sentinel file when its register() is called (meaning\n"
"Blender has loaded and enabled it). Sanctus Core reads these sentinels to\n"
"determine which expansions are currently active.\n"
"\n"
"This avoids relying on undocumented Blender APIs like enabled_extensions.\n"
"\n"
"How it works:\n"
"  1. Each expansion calls mark_enabled(ext_id) in its register().\n"
"  2. Each expansion calls mark_disabled(ext_id) in its unregister().\n"
"  3. Sanctus Core calls get_enabled_extensions() to get the set of active IDs.\n"
"\n"
"The sentinel files are stored in the extension's persistent user directory\n"
"(via bpy.utils.extension_path_user), which survives Blender restarts and is\n"
"kept between upgrades. This is the official Blender way to store per-extension\n"
"user data — see https://docs.blender.org/manual/en/latest/advanced/extensions/addons.html\n"
"(\"Local Storage\" section)."
msgstr ""
"扩展跟踪器 —— 用于启用/禁用检测的哨兵文件机制。\n"
"\n"
"每个扩展在其 register() 被调用时（即 Blender 已加载并启用了它）写入一个哨兵文件。Sanctus Core 读取这些哨兵文件以确定哪些扩展当前处于活动状态。\n"
"\n"
"这避免了依赖 undocumented Blender API（如 enabled_extensions）。\n"
"\n"
"工作原理：\n"
"  1. 每个扩展在其 register() 中调用 mark_enabled(ext_id)。\n"
"  2. 每个扩展在其 unregister() 中调用 mark_disabled(ext_id)。\n"
"  3. Sanctus Core 调用 get_enabled_extensions() 获取活动 ID 集合。\n"
"\n"
"哨兵文件存储在扩展的持久化用户目录中（通过 bpy.utils.extension_path_user），该目录可抵御 Blender 重启，并在升级之间保留。如果扩展被卸载，则该目录会被删除。这是官方 Blender 存储每扩展用户数据的方式——见 https://docs.blender.org/manual/en/latest/advanced/extensions/addons.html（\"Local Storage\"部分）。"

msgid ""
"Return the ROOT package of this extension (e.g. 'bl_ext.user_default.sanctus_viz').\n"
"\n"
"CRITICAL: bpy.utils.extension_path_user() requires the ROOT package of the\n"
"extension, NOT a submodule package. This module lives in the 'configs'\n"
"subpackage, so __package__ is 'bl_ext.user_default.sanctus_viz.configs'.\n"
"We must strip the trailing '.configs' to get the root package, otherwise\n"
"the sentinel is written to a DIFFERENT directory than the one that\n"
"detect_installed_expansions() reads (which uses the root package), and\n"
"Sanctus Library would never find the sentinel."
msgstr ""
"返回此扩展的根包（例如 'bl_ext.user_default.sanctus_viz'）。\n"
"\n"
"⚠️ 关键：bpy.utils.extension_path_user() 需要的是扩展的 ROOT 包，而不是子模块包。该模块位于 'configs' 子包中，因此 __package__ 是 'bl_ext.user_default.sanctus_viz.configs'。我们必须剥离末尾 '.configs' 以获取根包，否则哨兵将被写入与 detect_installed_expansions() 读取的不同目录（后者使用根包），Sanctus Library 将永远找不到该哨兵文件。"

msgid ""
"Return the persistent user directory for this extension.\n"
"\n"
"Uses the official bpy.utils.extension_path_user() API so the sentinel\n"
"survives Blender restarts (unlike bpy.app.tempdir, which is wiped each\n"
"session). The directory is kept between upgrades but removed if the\n"
"extension is uninstalled."
msgstr ""
"返回此扩展的持久化用户目录。\n"
"\n"
"使用官方 bpy.utils.extension_path_user() API，因此哨兵可抵御 Blender 重启（不同于 bpy.app.tempdir，它每次会话都会被清空）。该目录在升级之间保留，但如果扩展被卸载则会被删除。"

msgid "Get the sentinel file path for a given extension ID."
msgstr "获取给定扩展 ID 的哨兵文件路径。"

msgid "Called by an expansion's register() to signal it is enabled."
msgstr "由扩展的 register() 调用，用于通知其已启用。"

msgid "Called by an expansion's unregister() to signal it is disabled."
msgstr "由扩展的 unregister() 调用，用于通知其已禁用。"

msgid ""
"Return the set of extension IDs that have sentinel files.\n"
"\n"
"Scans the persistent user directory of THIS extension. For Sanctus Core\n"
"(the discoverer), this only finds sentinels written by Core itself. To\n"
"discover sentinels written by OTHER extensions (e.g. Sanctus Viz), use\n"
"is_enabled(ext_id, package) with each extension's package, or scan the\n"
"extension repos directly (see expansion_registry.detect_installed_expansions)."
msgstr ""
"返回拥有哨兵文件的扩展 ID 集合。\n"
"\n"
"扫描此扩展的持久化用户目录。对于 Sanctus Core（发现者），这只会找到 Core 自己写入的哨兵。要发现其他扩展（例如 Sanctus Viz）写下的哨兵，请使用 is_enabled(ext_id, package) 并传入每个扩展的包，或直接扫描扩展仓库（参见 expansion_registry.detect_installed_expansions）。"

msgid ""
"Check if a specific extension is enabled by sentinel presence.\n"
"\n"
"Checks BOTH the persistent user directory (bpy.utils.extension_path_user)\n"
"and the legacy bpy.app.tempdir location. The persistent directory is used\n"
"by Sanctus clones (e.g. Sanctus Viz) so the sentinel survives restarts.\n"
"The tempdir location is still used by standalone expansions (e.g. Sanctus\n"
"Liquid Works, Sanctus Wood Works) which write their sentinel unconditionally\n"
"in register() and re-write it every startup.\n"
"\n"
"Args:\n"
"    ext_id: The extension ID (e.g. \"sanctus_viz\").\n"
"    package: The extension's __package__ (e.g. \"bl_ext.user_default.sanctus_viz\").\n"
"             Defaults to this extension's own package."
msgstr ""
"检查特定扩展是否通过哨兵的存在处于启用状态。\n"
"\n"
"同时检查持久化用户目录（bpy.utils.extension_path_user）和旧版 bpy.app.tempdir 位置。持久化目录由 Sanctus 克隆使用（例如 Sanctus Viz），因此哨兵可抵御重启。tempdir 位置仍由独立扩展（例如 Sanctus Liquid Works, Sanctus Wood Works）使用，它们在 register() 中无条件写入哨兵，并在每次启动时重写它。\n"
"\n"
"参数：\n"
"    ext_id: 扩展 ID（例如 \"sanctus_viz\"）。\n"
"    package: 扩展的 __package__（例如 \"bl_ext.user_default.sanctus_viz\"）。默认为该扩展自己的包。"

