msgid ""
"HUD hover preview — large documentation images fetched from the internet.\n"
"\n"
"On hover over a HUD asset the addon builds the documentation image URL:\n"
"\n"
"    https://sanctusnodes.com/documentation/main/en/img/{type}/{category}/{name}.jpg\n"
"    (falling back to .png)\n"
"\n"
"and downloads it in a daemon thread. Downloaded bytes are cached in memory and\n"
"turned into a GPU texture on the MAIN thread by the HUD draw callback (GPU\n"
"objects are main-thread only).\n"
"\n"
"The rule (user-defined, verified against the deployed docs):\n"
"  - name      = thumbnail stem (e.g. ``anti_slip_01``) — the same name as the\n"
"                BIP/JPG thumbnail of the hovered preset.\n"
"  - type      = asset type folder (``material``, ``geometry_nodes``,\n"
"                ``nodetree``, ``decal``) derived from the asset_path.\n"
"  - category  = the library root: ``lib-sl`` (core SL), ``lib-viz`` (Viz), or\n"
"                the expansion slug (``liquid-works``, ``wood-works``).\n"
"\n"
"No connection or missing image => nothing is shown (no bad UX). The 1024px\n"
"previews are never shipped inside the addon zip."
msgstr ""
"HUD 悬停预览 —— 从互联网获取的大型文档图像。\n"
"\n"
"鼠标悬停在 HUD 资产上时，该插件构建文档图像的 URL：\n"
"\n"
"    https://sanctusnodes.com/documentation/main/en/img/{type}/{category}/{name}.jpg\n"
"    (回退为 .png)\n"
"\n"
"并在后台线程中下载。下载的字节数据缓存在内存中，并通过 HUD 绘制回调（GPU 对象仅限主线程）将其转换为 GPU 纹理。\n"
"\n"
"规则（用户自定义，与已部署文档比对验证）：\n"
"- name = 缩略图前缀（例如 `anti_slip_01`）——与悬停预设的 BIP/JPG 缩略图名称相同。\n"
"- type = 资产类型文件夹（`material`、`geometry_nodes`、`nodetree`、`decal`），源自 asset_path。\n"
"- category = 库根目录：`lib-sl`（核心 SL）、`lib-viz`（Viz）或扩展 slug（如 `liquid-works`、`wood-works`）。\n"
"\n"
"没有连接或找不到图像则不显示任何内容（避免不良用户体验）。1024px 预览不会打包在插件 zip 中。"

msgid "liquid-works"
msgstr "液体工坊"

msgid "wood-works"
msgstr "木材工坊"

msgid "lib-viz"
msgstr "lib-viz"

msgid ""
"Invalidate/reset the cached PIL check (call after deps install).\n"
"\n"
"Pass True/False to FORCE a known state, or None to reset to \"unknown\"\n"
"(re-checked lazily on the next request — the recommended call after an\n"
"install, so we re-test the actual import instead of trusting the caller)."
msgstr ""
"清除/重置缓存的 PIL 可用性检查（依赖安装后调用）。\n"
"\n"
"传 True/False 以强制指定已知状态，或 None 以重置为“未知”（下次请求时惰性重新检查——推荐在依赖安装后调用，这样会重新测试实际的导入，而不是相信调用者的声明）。"

msgid ""
"True if PIL can be imported. Checked once, then cached.\n"
"\n"
"Never polled: the value is fixed for the session unless\n"
"set_pil_available() invalidates it (successful deps install) or the\n"
"module reloads (Blender restart)."
msgstr ""
"True，如果 PIL 可以被导入。仅检查一次，然后缓存。\n"
"\n"
"不会轮询：该值在会话期间固定，除非 set_pil_available() 使其失效（成功的依赖安装）或模块重新加载（Blender 重启）。"

msgid ""
"Async downloader + caches for hover previews.\n"
"\n"
"Design notes (deterministic — no fragile flag juggling):\n"
"\n"
"  - ``request()`` starts a download for a NEW url and keeps the previous\n"
"    texture visible while it loads (no blink when switching assets).\n"
"  - ``poll_pending()`` (every draw frame) consumes two thread signals:\n"
"      * ``_pending_status (url, ok)`` — HTTP headers received (diagnostic\n"
"        only; the spinner no longer waits for it).\n"
"      * ``_pending (url, data)`` — body finished; texture built or failed.\n"
"  - ``is_active()`` is the ONLY gate the HUD modal uses to decide whether\n"
"    to keep redrawing. It is True whenever anything is on screen or in\n"
"    flight: texture visible, fade in/out running, spinner showing, or a\n"
"    download in progress. This guarantees the draw callback keeps running\n"
"    (and polling) for as long as the preview has something to do — no\n"
"    dead spinner, no preview that never appears.\n"
"  - The spinner shows IMMEDIATELY when a download starts — the user sees\n"
"    instant feedback instead of an empty box while the image loads. If\n"
"    the image turns out to be missing / no connection, the download\n"
"    fails, the box disappears, and the URL joins ``failed`` (no retry)."
msgstr ""
"异步下载器 + 悬停预览缓存。\n"
"\n"
"设计说明（确定性——避免脆弱的标志拼接）：\n"
"\n"
"- ``request()`` 会为新的 URL 启动下载，并在纹理加载期间保留之前的纹理可见（切换资产时无闪烁）。\n"
"- ``poll_pending()`` （每帧绘制时）消费两个线程信号：\n"
"    * ``_pending_status (url, ok)`` — HTTP 头信息已接收（仅用于诊断；旋转动画不再等待它）。\n"
"    * ``_pending (url, data)`` — 数据体完成；纹理构建成功或失败。\n"
"- ``is_active()`` 是 HUD 模态框决定是否继续重绘的**唯一**门禁。只要屏幕上有任何内容或在途，它就返回 True：纹理可见、淡出/淡入运行中、旋转动画显示，或下载进行中。这保证了绘制回调会持续运行（并轮询），只要预览还有事可做——不会留下僵死的加载指示器，不会出现永远不显示的预览。\n"
"- 当下载开始时，旋转动画**立即**显示——用户能看到即时反馈，而不是在图片加载中看到空框。如果图片缺失/无法连接，下载失败，框消失，URL 加入 ``failed``（不会重试）。"

msgid ""
"Ask for the preview of ``url``. Idempotent — safe to call per frame.\n"
"\n"
"If PIL is not installed the preview is completely disabled: no box,\n"
"no spinner, no download. PIL availability is cached once per session\n"
"and invalidated by EVENT (successful deps install -> set_pil_available,\n"
"or Blender restart -> fresh module). If PIL is removed mid-session,\n"
"the texture build fails and self-heals: it invalidates the cache, so\n"
"the next hover re-tests and disables the preview instead of showing\n"
"a dead spinner."
msgstr ""
"请求 ``url`` 的预览。幂等——每帧调用都安全。\n"
"\n"
"如果 PIL 未安装，预览完全禁用：无框、无旋转动画、无下载。PIL 可用性在每次会话中缓存一次，并通过事件使其失效（成功的依赖安装 -> set_pil_available，或 Blender 重启 -> 模块全新加载）。如果在会话期间 PIL 被移除，纹理构建失败并自我修复：它使缓存失效，因此下次悬停会重新测试并禁用预览，而不是显示僵死的旋转动画。"

msgid "No hover: start the fade-out of the current preview."
msgstr "无悬停：启动当前预览的淡出效果。"

msgid "Drop any in-progress fade (hover resumed)."
msgstr "中断任何已开始的淡入过程（悬停恢复）。"

msgid ""
"Current draw alpha for the preview.\n"
"\n"
"While fading out: 1 → 0 over _FADE_OUT_TIME.\n"
"Otherwise (fade-in): 0 → 1 over _FADE_IN_TIME after the texture\n"
"appeared. Returns a value in [0, 1]."
msgstr ""
"当前用于预览的绘制透明度。\n"
"\n"
"淡出时：从 1 → 0，历时 _FADE_OUT_TIME。\n"
